  "policies": [
    "Quantum uses the existing all-source TARGET/self damage scale2. Bralma and Goldrinn add only two finite native SOURCE health profiles, selecting current friendly elemental/beast physical minion sources via the shared complete tribe helper. Existing numeric/routing/protection/death/lifesteal rules remain shared.",
    "Unknown current minion tribes or a retired logical minion source without available current tribe facts error explicitly rather than being excluded or guessed. Exact source/current-type/retirement policies remain M6 requirements.",
    "Kayn is the current3/5 Core face and native Charge. One unconditional native friendly_ignore_taunt provider changes only the normal Taunt target check; it grants no extra attacks or target access through Stealth/Immune/Rush/freeze restrictions. Current source/control/silence/residence and original accepted attack rules remain shared. Tags858 links the complete BT_187 identity; use that canonical deck identity without registering the legacy face.",
    "Survivalist supplies self Immune only as its actual board minion and while no other friendly board-present minion exists. Dormant and dying ordinary minion occupants count until departure; locations, interactable objects and unlaunched Starship objects do not. State is derived without polling grants; exact occupancy/acceptance windows remain local M6 policy.",
    "Chromatus body and four heads remain unregistered and fully in scope. No guessed original-parent Deathrattle restriction, arbitrary named-body selection or blank implementation. Full Standard/Core/hotfix/reachable/generator/CN certification remains open."
  ]
